        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 4405 Globe Colored Glass Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA perfect enhancement for traditional or contemporary homes, the Globe Cabinet Knob is made from glass. The rounded ball design is proportioned to comfortably fit the palm of the hand. This colored glass knob with its classic ridges is a great choice. It is available in 4 color choices (Transparent, Rose, Azure, or Jade) each of which can come either clear or frosted with either a polished brass or polished chrome base.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/romantic-colored-glass-cabinet-knob-omnia-4341\"><b>Romantic Colored Glass Cabinet Knob</b></a>. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Globe Colored Glass Cabinet Door Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Glass</li>\r\n<li>Rose Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>OMN-4405/25</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>OMN-4405/30</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-9/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
